#: ../../architecture.md:1
#: c2f045848321457e9f9022102553751b
msgid "How it is built"
msgstr "它是怎麼建起來的"

#: ../../architecture.md:3
#: 6f6ab366c76b4cc0bc8ae54386d1e2ef
msgid ""
"This page is for someone changing the code rather than using it. "
"Everything before it describes the workbench from the outside; this is "
"the seam map — what each half owns, what crosses between them, and where "
"a change to one half forces a change to the other."
msgstr "這一頁寫給要改動程式碼的人，而不是使用它的人。前面每一頁都是從外面描述這套工作台；這一頁是接縫的地圖——兩邊各自擁有什麼、之間傳遞什麼，以及改動其中一邊會在哪裡逼著另一邊也得改。"

#: ../../architecture.md:8
#: 6d11b7e3c84740168dc27b08edd1d475
msgid ""
"Three documents are the authority behind it, and are worth having open "
"beside it: `ql-backend/doc/DESIGN.md` for why the service is shaped the way "
"it is, cited to QuantLib's own source; `ql-backend/doc/HANDLERS.md` for every"
" frame and field it accepts; and `PLAN.md` for this client's design "
"record, including what was deliberately not built. This page is the map. "
"Those are the terrain."
msgstr ""
"它背後有三份權威文件，值得一起打開：`ql-backend/doc/DESIGN.md` 說明服務為何長成這樣，並逐條引用 QuantLib 自己的原始碼"
"；`ql-backend/doc/HANDLERS.md` 列出它接受的每一個訊框與欄位；`PLAN.md` "
"則是這個用戶端的設計紀錄，包含刻意不做的部分。這一頁是地圖，那三份是地形。"

#: ../../architecture.md:14
#: 579898fd28c94c1bb85e5b618585c6af
msgid "Two programs, one schema"
msgstr "兩支程式，一份綱要"

#: ../../architecture.md:16
#: f9cce635884e412ea197e59d18ad1922
msgid ""
"Two panels side by side. ql-frontend, a browser tab, is four stacked "
"layers: components, store, operations and WireClient. ql-backend, one "
"process, is four stacked layers: gateway, supervisor, worker and Session."
" A binary WebSocket joins WireClient to the gateway, carrying one "
"ClientFrame out and one ServerFrame back. Below both, a band for "
"proto/quantlib/v2, the one schema each side generates its bindings from."
msgstr ""
"兩塊並排的面板。ql-frontend 是一個瀏覽器分頁，由四層堆疊而成：components、store、operations 與 "
"WireClient。ql-backend 是一個行程，同樣四層：gateway、supervisor、worker 與 "
"Session。一條二進位 WebSocket 把 WireClient 接到 gateway，往外送出一個 ClientFrame，往回帶一個 "
"ServerFrame。兩者下方是一條 proto/quantlib/v2 的橫帶，也就是兩邊各自產生繫結時所依據的那一份綱要。"

#: ../../architecture.md:20
#: 68640f502240486fabfe02378d61f3da
msgid ""
"Each half in the order a request meets it. The only thing that crosses is"
" a frame, which is why the schema rather than the code is the contract "
"between them."
msgstr "每一邊都按著一個請求遇到它們的順序排列。真正跨過中間的只有訊框，這也是為什麼兩者之間的契約是那份綱要，而不是程式碼。"

#: ../../architecture.md:25
#: 7558d8de47784a5b9613e3f38bb84bd2
msgid ""
"The two repositories share `ql-protobuf`, pinned as a submodule in each. "
"Nobody writes a frame by hand and nobody commits a generated binding: the"
" C++ side is generated by `protoc` from `CMakeLists.txt`, the TypeScript "
"side by `npm run gen` into `src/gen/`, which is gitignored. One source of"
" truth, and no stale copy to disagree with it."
msgstr ""
"兩個原始碼庫共用 `ql-protobuf`，各自以子模組固定在同一個提交上。沒有人手寫訊框，也沒有人把產生出來的繫結簽進版本庫：C++ 這邊由 "
"`CMakeLists.txt` 呼叫 `protoc` 產生，TypeScript 這邊由 `npm run gen` 產生到 "
"`src/gen/`，而該目錄被 gitignore。單一事實來源，不會有過期的副本跟它唱反調。"

#: ../../architecture.md:31
#: 12d183b9314b4e4cb6cfb208f3b7c732
msgid ""
"WebSocket already delimits messages, so a frame carries no length prefix "
"— one serialized `ClientFrame` or `ServerFrame` per binary message. Every"
" request carries a `request_id` the client allocates and a `session_id`, "
"and every request ends in exactly one terminal frame."
msgstr ""
"WebSocket 本身就會切分訊息，所以訊框不帶長度前綴——一個二進位訊息就是一個序列化過的 `ClientFrame` 或 "
"`ServerFrame`。每一個請求都帶著用戶端配發的 `request_id` 與一個 "
"`session_id`，而每一個請求都恰好以一個終結訊框收尾。"

