#: ../../architecture.md:48
#: b62fcf0801a745de88f661eca2c10fd7
msgid ""
"**The event loop is single threaded, and that is load-bearing.** "
"Everything that touches the supervisor runs on it, which is what lets "
"`sessions_` and `workers_` be mutated from six entry points with no mutex"
" (`gateway.hpp:18-20`). The supervisor has no thread and no timer of its "
"own — the gateway arms the grace timers and reports every terminal frame "
"back — so \"who is on which thread\" has one answer rather than six."
msgstr ""
"**事件迴圈是單執行緒的，而這件事撐著整個設計。** 每一件碰到監督者的事都跑在它上面，這才使得 `sessions_` 與 `workers_`"
" "
"可以從六個進入點被修改而不需要任何互斥鎖（`gateway.hpp:18-20`）。監督者沒有自己的執行緒，也沒有自己的計時器——寬限計時器由閘道啟動，每一個終結訊框也由閘道回報——所以「誰跑在哪條執行緒上」只有一個答案，而不是六個。"

#: ../../architecture.md:55
#: d8c4d251191648ecbff50f784f5ebebf
msgid ""
"**One session is one thread for its whole life.** Every QuantLib "
"singleton is session-local and none is declared global, so a build "
"without `QL_ENABLE_SESSIONS` gives two concurrent requests one process-"
"wide `Settings::evaluationDate()` and two silently wrong prices. With it,"
" `Singleton<T>::instance()` is `thread_local` "
"(`ql/patterns/singleton.hpp:92`), and a graph built on one thread must "
"never be priced on another. `Worker` constructs its `Session` *inside* "
"`run()` for that reason, never on the caller's thread "
"(`worker.hpp:29-35`)."
msgstr ""
"**一個工作階段一輩子綁在一條執行緒上。** QuantLib 的每一個單例都是工作階段區域的，沒有一個宣告為全域，所以沒有開 "
"`QL_ENABLE_SESSIONS` 的建置會讓兩個並行請求共用同一個行程層級的 "
"`Settings::evaluationDate()`，得到兩個安靜地錯掉的價格。開了之後，`Singleton<T>::instance()`"
" 是 "
"`thread_local`（`ql/patterns/singleton.hpp:92`），而在某條執行緒上建起來的物件圖，絕不能在另一條上定價。`Worker`"
" 正是為此在 `run()` *裡面*建構它的 `Session`，絕不在呼叫端的執行緒上建（`worker.hpp:29-35`）。"

#: ../../architecture.md:64
#: e0a6a7cd83134073a145d1e9c0249772
msgid ""
"**Within a session, everything serializes.** Not merely writes: `NPV()` "
"writes to the lazy cache as it computes, so two nominally read-only "
"prices on one graph cannot overlap. Concurrency comes from more sessions,"
" never from more threads inside one. A hundred-strike smile is a hundred "
"sessions or a loop — which is why the compare panel opens a second "
"session rather than fanning out on the one in front of you."
msgstr ""
"**在一個工作階段裡，一切都是序列化的。** 不只是寫入：`NPV()` "
"在計算過程中就會寫進惰性快取，所以同一份物件圖上兩個名義上唯讀的定價也不能重疊。並行度來自更多的工作階段，絕不來自一個工作階段裡更多的執行緒。一條含一百個履約價的微笑曲線，就是一百個工作階段或一個迴圈——這也是為什麼比較面板會另開第二個工作階段，而不是在你眼前這個上面散開。"

#: ../../architecture.md:71
#: a47fb02e92e4417e8551ba735b0d6079
msgid ""
"**Placement is a property of the request.** A session opens in a shared "
"worker (eight seats by default) and moves to a sacrificial single-session"
" process when it asks for something long and cancellable. Moving is a "
"close and a replay, not a migration, because the graph is thread-bound. "
"That is the whole reason a `SessionLog` exists: `OpenSession` plus the "
"accepted `UpdateMarket` frames determine the graph completely, so a "
"session that loses its worker is rebuilt under the same `session_id` and "
"the client is never told it moved. What a seat and a worker actually are "
"in this build is the next section."
msgstr ""
"**安置是請求的屬性，不是工作階段的屬性。** "
"工作階段一開始開在共用的工作者裡（預設八個座位），當它要求某件長而且可取消的工作時，才搬到可犧牲的單一工作階段行程去。搬家是關閉再重播，不是遷移，因為物件圖綁在執行緒上。這就是"
" `SessionLog` 存在的全部理由：`OpenSession` 加上被接受的那些 `UpdateMarket` "
"完全決定了物件圖，所以失去工作者的工作階段會以同一個 `session_id` "
"重建，而用戶端從來不會被告知它搬過家。在這個建置裡，一個座位和一個工作者實際上是什麼，就是下一節的內容。"

#: ../../architecture.md:80
#: 52b06e74b6734f56b90f5b6d8578bb34
msgid ""
"**Every rejection names a field.** `QLS_FIELD_REQUIRE` and "
"`QLS_FIELD_FAIL` (`src/errors/fielderror.hpp:66,77`) raise an error "
"carrying a wire code and the dotted path of the field to blame; "
"`session.cpp` uses them 204 times. That path is what the interface "
"highlights, and it is why nothing this build cannot price is silently "
"ignored — the schema is deliberately wider than the build, and the gap "
"between them is answered rather than approximated."
msgstr ""
"**每一次拒絕都指名一個欄位。** `QLS_FIELD_REQUIRE` 與 "
"`QLS_FIELD_FAIL`（`src/errors/fielderror.hpp:66,77`）拋出的錯誤帶著一個線上錯誤碼，以及該負責的欄位的點分路徑；`session.cpp`"
" 用了它們 204 "
"次。介面高亮的就是那條路徑，這也是為什麼這個版本定不出來的東西不會被默默忽略——綱要刻意比建置寬，而兩者之間的落差是被回答，而不是被近似。"

#: ../../architecture.md:87
#: d8a2909d073e45c7b78d392f74981cd0
msgid "Threads and processes"
msgstr "執行緒與行程"

#: ../../architecture.md:89
#: be612e9b534346488ad11861341f1bee
msgid ""
"The layer table says a worker is one thread and one session. This is what"
" that adds up to at runtime, and it is worth having straight before "
"reading either repository, because the vocabulary of the design and the "
"shape of this build are not the same thing: `DESIGN.md` §2.1 is written "
"for worker processes, and this build has none."
msgstr ""
"上面那張分層表說，一個工作者就是一條執行緒、一個工作階段。這一節講的是這件事在執行期加總起來會是什麼樣子；在讀任何一邊的原始碼之前先弄清楚是值得的，因為設計的用語和這個建置的形狀並不是同一回事：`DESIGN.md`"
" §2.1 是為工作者行程寫的，而這個建置一個都沒有。"

#: ../../architecture.md:95
#: 6078577f9e6647acaf135c0ee5e88e03
msgid ""
"One outer box is the single ql-backend process, which never forks. Across"
" its top the gateway loop is one thread. Below it two dashed boxes are "
"the supervisor's workers: w-1, shared, holding session lanes A, B and C "
"with room for eight; and w-2, sacrificial, holding session D. Each lane "
"is one thread and one session. An arrow between the two boxes shows a "
"session moving for a Monte Carlo, by being closed and replayed. At the "
"right, a detached reaper thread joins the work a kill left running. A "
"band below states the count: one gateway loop, plus one thread per live "
"session, plus one per abandoned calculation."
msgstr ""
"最外層的方框是唯一的 ql-backend 行程，它從不 fork。方框頂端橫著的閘道迴圈是一條執行緒。下方兩個虛線框是監督者的工作者：w-1 "
"是共用的，裝著工作階段 A、B、C 三條泳道，還有容納到第八個座位的空間；w-2 是可犧牲的，裝著工作階段 "
"D。每一條泳道就是一條執行緒、一個工作階段。兩個框之間的箭頭表示一個工作階段為了跑蒙地卡羅而搬家，做法是關閉再重播。右側是一條 detached "
"的回收執行緒，負責 join 那些 kill "
"留下來還在跑的工作。下方的橫幅寫出總數：一條閘道迴圈，加上每個存活工作階段一條，再加上每個被放生的計算一條。"

#: ../../architecture.md:99
#: 6b535ff3907b4095916ca51a22e9cd82
msgid ""
"Everything with a `std::thread` behind it, and the two boxes that have "
"none. `w-1` and `w-2` are entries in a map; a seat becomes a thread only "
"when a frame arrives for the session sitting in it."
msgstr ""
"所有背後真的有一條 `std::thread` 的東西，以及兩個一條都沒有的方框。`w-1` 與 `w-2` 只是 map "
"裡的項目；一個座位要等到有訊框送給坐在上面的工作階段時，才會變成一條執行緒。"

#: ../../architecture.md:104
#: e10ccec21c53481bbf761731a67ea751
msgid ""
"**One process, and it never makes another.** There is no `fork`, `exec*`,"
" `posix_spawn`, `popen` or Boost.Process anywhere in `src/`. `main.cpp` "
"builds a `Gateway` and calls `run()`, which enters `app.run()` on the "
"main thread (`gateway.cpp:833`) and stays there. Everything §2.1 calls a "
"worker process is an entry in a `std::map` here: "
"`ThreadProcessHost::spawn` invents an id, records a placement, and starts"
" nothing at all (`threadhost.cpp:32-36`)."
msgstr "**只有一個行程，而且它從不另開一個。** `src/` 裡任何地方都沒有 `fork`、`exec*`、`posix_spawn`、`popen` 或 Boost.Process。`main.cpp` 建一個 `Gateway` 再呼叫 `run()`，進到主執行緒上的 `app.run()`（`gateway.cpp:833`）之後就停在那裡。§2.1 稱為工作者行程的一切，在這裡都只是一個 `std::map` 裡的項目：`ThreadProcessHost::spawn` 生一個 id、記下安置方式，什麼都沒啟動（`threadhost.cpp:32-36`）。"

#: ../../architecture.md:111
#: d12fe90f7c40486693f6a43cc0c159f0
msgid "**Threads are created per session and never pooled.**"
msgstr "**執行緒是按工作階段建立的，從不做池化。**"

