#: ../../architecture.md:119
#: cbcf567e5615435ea46ce811d6dbbe37
msgid ""
"Those are the only two `std::thread` in the service. There is no pool, "
"and no queue of work for threads to be drawn against: no `std::async`, no"
" TBB, OpenMP forced off (`CMakeLists.txt:50`), and uSockets compiled "
"without its `libuv.c` and `gcd.c` backends (`CMakeLists.txt:195-196`), so"
" the transport has no helper threads of its own either. The live count is"
" one, plus the open sessions, plus whatever abandoned calculations are "
"still running."
msgstr ""
"整個服務裡只有這兩處 `std::thread`。沒有執行緒池，也沒有一個讓執行緒去取用的工作佇列：沒有 `std::async`、沒有 "
"TBB，OpenMP 被強制關掉（`CMakeLists.txt:50`），uSockets 也是在排除 `libuv.c` 與 `gcd.c` "
"這兩個事件後端的情況下編譯的（`CMakeLists.txt:195-196`），所以傳輸層自己也沒有輔助執行緒。任一瞬間的條數就是：一，加上開著的工作階段，再加上那些已經被放生、還在跑的計算。"

#: ../../architecture.md:126
#: d24984bbe8474644a07e9070dc700c0f
msgid ""
"**\"Worker\" names two things and only one of them is a thread.** The "
"class (`session/worker.*`) is one thread owning one session for the "
"session's whole life. The supervisor's `workerId` is a *process* — a "
"placement and a set of seats — and owns no thread at all; a shared worker"
" holding eight sessions is eight `Worker` objects and eight threads. "
"`Supervisor::killWorker` addresses the process-shaped thing and "
"`Worker::requestStop` the thread, and both appear in the same call path."
msgstr ""
"**「工作者」指的是兩件事，而其中只有一件是執行緒。** "
"那個類別（`session/worker.*`）是一條執行緒擁有一個工作階段，直到該工作階段結束為止。監督者口中的 `workerId` "
"則是一個*行程*——一種安置方式加上一組座位——它自己完全不擁有執行緒；一個裝了八個工作階段的共用工作者，就是八個 `Worker` "
"物件、八條執行緒。`Supervisor::killWorker` 對付的是那個行程形狀的東西，`Worker::requestStop` "
"對付的是執行緒，而兩者出現在同一條呼叫路徑上。"

#: ../../architecture.md:134
#: a1bc6525bf154e719672b17f5012fa69
msgid ""
"**Nothing bounds the thread count against the size of the machine.** "
"`acquireSeat` takes the first shared worker with room and starts another "
"whenever none has any (`supervisor.cpp:127-148`), nothing caps how many "
"workers there may be, and the supervisor holds no queue of sessions "
"waiting for a seat. The ninth concurrent session therefore gets a ninth "
"thread rather than a queue slot, and the only ceiling is the gateway's: "
"`maxConnections` × `maxSessionsPerConnection`, 32 × 16 by default, so 512"
" session threads — a figure chosen for socket safety rather than for "
"cores. `sessionsPerSharedWorker` bounds what one kill would take down "
"with it, not how much runs at once, and DESIGN §2.1 says so in those "
"words. Capping the pool and queueing sessions in front of it is an open "
"question rather than an intent this falls short of (§8): it costs latency"
" on the first request of every session, and what a fanned-out panel "
"actually does to a box is worth measuring before paying that."
msgstr "**沒有任何東西讓執行緒的數量對齊機器的大小。** `acquireSeat` 取第一個還有空位的共用工作者，一個有空位的都沒有時就再開一個（`supervisor.cpp:127-148`），工作者能開幾個沒有上限，監督者也沒有一個「等座位的工作階段」佇列。所以第九個並行的工作階段拿到的是第九條執行緒，而不是一個排隊位置；唯一的天花板是閘道的：`maxConnections` × `maxSessionsPerConnection`，預設 32 × 16，也就是 512 條工作階段執行緒——這個數字是為了通訊端的安全而定，不是為了核心數。`sessionsPerSharedWorker` 限制的是一次 kill 會連帶帶走多少東西，不是同時跑多少，而 DESIGN §2.1 用的正是這個說法。把池子設上限、在它前面讓工作階段排隊，是一個尚未決定的問題，而不是這裡沒達到的意圖（§8）：那會讓每個工作階段的第一個請求多付一段延遲，而一個扇開的面板究竟會對一台機器造成什麼，值得先量過再付這個代價。"

#: ../../architecture.md:149
#: 296e674476f649e89f1ed55fb3cf1043
msgid ""
"**Parallelism is across sessions and nowhere else.** Two sessions price "
"at the same time on two threads with nothing between them: `session.cpp` "
"holds no mutex, because every QuantLib singleton is `thread_local` and "
"each session has its own `Settings`, evaluation date and `IndexManager`. "
"Within one session the worker serves its queue one frame at a time, and a"
" single price never uses more than one core — QuantLib has no thread pool"
" of its own and its four OpenMP pragmas are off here (§2.2). Two sessions"
" on a multi-core machine is a real 2×; one session is never more than 1×."
msgstr ""
"**並行只發生在工作階段之間，別無他處。** 兩個工作階段可以在兩條執行緒上同時定價，中間什麼都不隔：`session.cpp` "
"裡沒有任何互斥鎖，因為 QuantLib 的每個單例都是 `thread_local`，每個工作階段都有自己的 `Settings`、評價日與 "
"`IndexManager`。在一個工作階段之內，工作者一次只服務佇列裡的一個訊框；而單一次定價從來不會用到一個以上的核心——QuantLib "
"自己沒有執行緒池，它那四個 OpenMP pragma "
"在這裡是關掉的（§2.2）。在多核機器上，兩個工作階段是實打實的兩倍；一個工作階段永遠不會超過一倍。"

#: ../../architecture.md:158
#: aa1ffd98e95e43fc9f92d116812f36e8
msgid ""
"**Moving a session between seats is a close and a replay.** "
"`placementFor` keys on the engine: Monte Carlo and finite difference take"
" a sacrificial seat, everything else a shared one "
"(`supervisor.cpp:240-260`), and a batch inherits the placement of the "
"longest thing in it. When that disagrees with where the session is "
"sitting, the supervisor closes it on the old seat, takes a new one, and "
"replays the `SessionLog` into it (`supervisor.cpp:297-323`); the next "
"analytic price brings it back. The graph is thread-bound and cannot be "
"handed over, so each move costs a fresh bootstrap."
msgstr "**把工作階段在座位之間搬動，是一次關閉加一次重播。** `placementFor` 看的是引擎：蒙地卡羅與有限差分去可犧牲的座位，其餘的去共用座位（`supervisor.cpp:240-260`），而一個批次會繼承它裡面最長那件工作的安置。當這個結果和工作階段目前坐的地方不一致，監督者就在舊座位上把它關掉、取一個新座位，再把 `SessionLog` 重播進去（`supervisor.cpp:297-323`）；下一次解析定價又會把它帶回來。物件圖綁在執行緒上、無法交接，所以每搬一次就要付一次重新啟動的代價。"

#: ../../architecture.md:167
#: b917d318b42e4271b6d09a7c533b352f
msgid ""
"Two things ride along with the replay, and both are there because the old"
" seat is closed rather than killed. Writes still waiting on an `Ack` are "
"re-sent to the new seat as request-less frames: the close queues behind "
"them, so the old seat applies and answers them and the log takes each on "
"its `Ack`, and without the re-send the new graph would stand one write "
"behind the old one. And a move waits while a cancel round is open, "
"because the target is running on the old seat and would answer for "
"itself: emitting `CANCELLED` here as well would be two terminal frames on"
" one request id."
msgstr "有兩件事會跟著這次重播一起走，而它們之所以存在，都是因為舊座位是被關閉而不是被 kill 掉。還在等 `Ack` 的寫入會以不帶請求編號的訊框重送到新座位：關閉指令排在它們後面，所以舊座位仍會套用並回答它們，而記錄簿會在各自的 `Ack` 上收下每一筆；少了這次重送，新的物件圖就會比舊的少一筆寫入。另外，當一輪取消還開著時，搬動會先等：目標正跑在舊座位上、會自己回答，若在這裡也送出一個 `CANCELLED`，同一個請求編號上就會有兩個終結訊框。"

#: ../../architecture.md:176
#: aa089937bf6c4c3cb5e891603c160634
msgid ""
"**A kill is a disown.** `ThreadProcessHost::kill` asks the worker to "
"stop, sets its `alive` flag false so every frame it emits afterwards is "
"dropped on the loop, and hands the seat to a detached reaper "
"(`threadhost.cpp:117-131`). The calculation runs to completion and keeps "
"its core the whole time; the supervisor has already answered `CANCELLED` "
"and replayed the session elsewhere, so the seat comes back when the work "
"ends rather than when the user asks for it. Three shapes stop for real, "
"and they are the three with an outer loop this service wrote rather than "
"an engine call it cannot reach into: a batched Monte Carlo between "
"batches (`session.cpp:2931`), a sweep between points (`worker.cpp:347`), "
"and a book between trades (`worker.cpp:462`)."
msgstr "**kill 其實是斷絕關係。** `ThreadProcessHost::kill` 會請工作者停下來，把它的 `alive` 旗標設成 false，讓它之後送出的每一個訊框都在迴圈上被丟掉，再把座位交給一條 detached 的回收執行緒（`threadhost.cpp:117-131`）。那個計算會一路跑完，而且全程佔著一顆核心；監督者早就回了 `CANCELLED` 並把工作階段重播到別處，所以座位是在工作結束時才回來，不是在使用者要求時。真正停得下來的有三種形狀，就是那三種外層迴圈由這個服務自己寫、而不是它伸不進去的引擎呼叫：分批的蒙地卡羅在批次之間（`session.cpp:2931`）、掃描在點與點之間（`worker.cpp:347`），以及一本部位在交易與交易之間（`worker.cpp:462`）。"

#: ../../architecture.md:187
#: 664af3f769a94aab84343433ced1b894
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**One process is one blast radius.** Every session graph, every "
"`SessionLog` and the gateway's connection state share an address space "
"and a heap. `Worker::serve` catches `FieldError`, `Cancelled`, "
"`QuantLib::Error`, `std::exception` and anything else "
"(`worker.cpp:631-667`), so a rejected trade or a failed bootstrap is "
"answered on the wire and costs its session nothing. The gateway's loop "
"callbacks run through `guarded` for the same reason (`gateway.cpp:333`): "
"a `defer` or a timer tick that threw used to be `std::terminate` for the "
"process, which made one fault in the supervisor's bookkeeping everybody's"
" fault. What is left is the hardware-shaped half. A segfault still takes "
"every other session with it, and {doc}`limits` states that from the "
"outside. The seam that would end it is already the only one that has to "
"change: `Supervisor::ProcessHost`, which decides no policy and which the "
"supervisor's tests already substitute."
msgstr "**一個行程就是一個波及範圍。** 每一份工作階段的物件圖、每一份 `SessionLog`，以及閘道的連線狀態，共用同一個位址空間與同一個堆積。`Worker::serve` 會接住 `FieldError`、`Cancelled`、`QuantLib::Error`、`std::exception`，以及其他任何東西（`worker.cpp:631-667`），所以一筆被拒絕的交易或一次失敗的啟動只會在線上被回答，對它的工作階段毫無代價。閘道迴圈上的回呼也基於同樣的理由走 `guarded`（`gateway.cpp:333`）：一個丟出例外的 `defer` 或計時器滴答，過去等於整個行程 `std::terminate`，那會讓監督者記帳上的一個小錯變成所有人的錯。剩下的是硬體形狀的那一半：一次 segfault 仍然會把其他每一個工作階段一起帶走，而 {doc}`limits` 從外面說明了這件事。要終結它的接縫，已經是唯一需要改的那一個：`Supervisor::ProcessHost`，它不決定任何政策，監督者的測試也早就用替身把它換掉了。"

