#: ../../architecture.md:324
#: 2c102b9a63334563a427ff6199775b65
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Three things are known gaps rather than oversights, and all three are "
"written up where they belong. {doc}`limits` states them from the outside,"
" with the rest of what this build will not do; here is what in the code "
"makes them true."
msgstr ""
"有三件事是已知的缺口，而不是疏忽，三件都寫在它們該在的地方。{doc}`limits` "
"從外面陳述它們，連同這個版本其餘做不到的事；這裡則是程式碼裡讓它們成立的東西。"

#: ../../architecture.md:328
#: fe24d75127cb4cfe8abf6e8da22cdb1b
msgid ""
"**Workers are threads, not processes.** `ThreadProcessHost` makes them "
"thread groups inside the gateway, so a kill can only disown a thread "
"rather than end it (`threadhost.cpp:117-131`), and a cancel that has to "
"kill therefore leaks the work instead of stopping it (`DESIGN.md` §3). "
"That is the whole of what is missing. Replay itself runs: a worker that "
"leaves a graph half-invalidated says so through a `DeathSink` "
"(`worker.cpp:671`), the host reports the session on the loop and disowns "
"the seat (`threadhost.cpp:134`), and the supervisor rebuilds it from the "
"log under the same `session_id` (`supervisor.cpp:496`). A thread reports "
"one session where a process would take its co-tenants with it, which is "
"the one place the two shapes differ."
msgstr "**工作者是執行緒，不是行程。** `ThreadProcessHost` 把它們做成閘道行程內部的執行緒群組，所以一次 kill 只能和一條執行緒斷絕關係，而不能真的結束它（`threadhost.cpp:117-131`），因此一次必須動用 kill 的取消會讓那份工作外洩，而不是停下來（`DESIGN.md` §3）。缺的就只有這件事。重播本身是會跑的：一個把物件圖弄成半失效的工作者，會透過 `DeathSink` 說出來（`worker.cpp:671`），主機在迴圈上回報這個工作階段並和座位斷絕關係（`threadhost.cpp:134`），監督者再依記錄簿以同一個 `session_id` 把它重建起來（`supervisor.cpp:496`）。一條執行緒回報的是一個工作階段，而一個行程會把同住的鄰居一起帶走——這正是兩種形狀唯一不同的地方。"

#: ../../architecture.md:339
#: 3ee147f8b4c74803b65760798d3a08a6
msgid ""
"**The gateway is a single point of failure.** It holds every session log "
"in memory, nothing here touches a disk, and losing the process loses "
"every graph on the box. What makes that survivable is not in the service "
"at all: the client holds the definition and replays it, which is why the "
"replay path must keep working even though resume is usually faster."
msgstr ""
"**閘道是單點故障。** "
"它把每一份工作階段紀錄都放在記憶體裡，這裡沒有任何東西碰到磁碟，失去這個行程就失去這台機器上的每一份物件圖。讓這件事還撐得住的東西根本不在服務裡：用戶端握有定義並且會重播它，這也是為什麼即使接回通常比較快，重播那條路仍然必須保持能用。"

#: ../../architecture.md:345
#: 1a7a5807c100499ea558e3247537604d
msgid ""
"**There is a door and a lock, and no notion of who anybody is.** The "
"`Origin` check, a connection cap and a session cap are the door, and they"
" close the browser: loopback is not a boundary against a page, because a "
"WebSocket upgrade is not subject to the same-origin policy. `--token-"
"file` is the lock, checked in the upgrade handler so a refusal costs no "
"socket, and it closes the other user's process on the same machine — the "
"half no reverse proxy can close, since a proxy stands beside this service"
" rather than in front of its loopback socket. An address that is not "
"loopback is refused without one."
msgstr "**有一道門和一把鎖，卻沒有「誰是誰」這回事。** `Origin` 檢查、連線數上限與工作階段數上限是那道門，它們擋住的是瀏覽器：loopback 對一個網頁並不是邊界，因為 WebSocket 的升級不受同源政策約束。`--token-file` 是那把鎖，在升級處理程序裡檢查，所以一次拒絕不用付出任何一個通訊端的代價；它擋住的是同一台機器上其他使用者的行程——那是任何反向代理都擋不住的一半，因為代理站在這個服務旁邊，而不是站在它的 loopback socket 前面。沒有鎖時，不是 loopback 的位址會被拒絕。"

#: ../../architecture.md:354
#: db43d05a21914dde8892eb030433bcc4
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"What neither supplies is identity or transport security. There is no TLS "
"and no user, the token is a single shared secret that anything able to "
"read the token file or this app's bundle can present, and a process "
"running as that user is therefore not kept out by any of it. "
"{doc}`limits` draws that line from the outside and {doc}`getting-started`"
" has the operational version."
msgstr "這兩者都沒有提供的，是身分與傳輸安全。沒有 TLS，也沒有使用者這回事；權杖是單一一份共用密鑰，任何讀得到權杖檔案、或讀得到這個應用程式 bundle 的東西都能出示它，因此以那位使用者的身分執行的行程，並不會被其中任何一項擋在外面。{doc}`limits` 從外面畫出那條線，而 {doc}`getting-started` 是它的操作版本。"

